      <title>Duesko 0.5</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:57:41 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>0.5.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.0.19041</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The first version of Duesko for Windows.</p>
<ul>
<li>Every screen of the Mac app: overview, calendar, analytics, subscription lists, budget and settings.</li>
<li>Reminders from Windows, even when Duesko is closed, and a summary in the notification area.</li>
<li>Opens backups and CSV files made by the Mac version.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
